{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"report_supported\": \"partly\",\n  \"judge_supported\": \"cannot_tell\",\n  \"report_quotes\": [\n    \"PMID:41659700 | Effects of different types of deep brain stimulation on gait disorders in patients with Parkinson's disease: a network meta-analysis of randomized controlled trials. (2025)\",\n    \"From a quantitative standpoint, these manifestations can be operationalized through specific spatiotemporal gait metrics, including stride length, gait speed, cadence, swing and stance phase proportions, step variability indices, and turning performance, each of which reflects distinct pathophysiological substrates of the disease (Guo et al., 2022; Nutt et al., 2011; Johansson et al., 2023).\"\n  ],\n  \"judge_quotes\": [\n    \"PMID:41659700 | Effects of different types of deep brain stimulation on gait disorders in patients with Parkinson's disease: a network meta-analysis of randomized controlled trials. (2025)\",\n    \"The protocol was registered on June 15, 2025, in the PROSPERO database (https://www.crd.york.ac.uk/prospero/; registration ID: CRD420251074368) to ensure methodological transparency and reproducibility.\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"报告的年份字段填写为2025有全文依据：文件开头的书目信息明确将论文标注为(2025)。但全文没有明确列出本文作者姓名，无法确认Guo是否为该论文的第一作者。正文中出现的Guo et al.明确对应2022年的参考文献，不能据此证明本文应标注为Guo 2025。因此，报告的说法只能判为partly。对于指控者，全文没有出现2026年1月22日这一日期，也没有明确记载本文的正式出版日期或DOI。全文出现的2025年6月15日是PROSPERO方案注册日期，并非论文出版日期。虽然全文开头标注了(2025)，但仅凭该全文既不能确认正式出版日期为2026年1月22日，也不能否定这一日期。因此，指控者关于正式出版日期的说法属于全文无法判断的事项，判为cannot_tell。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "78b431a8-6484-46dd-8f5c-55f68da4cef8", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261113T125048925484Z", "elapsed_seconds": 68.797, "completed_utc": "2026-11-13T12:51:57.725298+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "